1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,380
What's happening in Sudan and how you can help.

2
00:00:02,600 --> 00:00:04,340
Sudan is currently experiencing a civil war.

3
00:00:04,740 --> 00:00:08,420
The fighting began in April and since then over 9,000 people have lost their life.

4
00:00:08,600 --> 00:00:12,920
The conflict comes from weeks of tension between the Rapid Support Forces and the Sudanese Armed Forces

5
00:00:12,920 --> 00:00:17,240
over security force reform during negotiations for a new transitional government.

6
00:00:17,600 --> 00:00:21,880
Ironically, the last transitional government was overthrown by the Rapid Support Forces

7
00:00:21,880 --> 00:00:24,600
and the Sudanese Armed Forces jointly in October 2021.

8
00:00:24,860 --> 00:00:27,400
Innocent civilians in Sudan are being killed and displaced.

9
00:00:27,400 --> 00:00:31,860
As the conflict continues to rage, thousands of lives are being needlessly lost.

10
00:00:32,040 --> 00:00:35,060
Not to mention the devastating impact the war is having on women and children.

11
00:00:35,360 --> 00:00:38,420
Recently released reports detailed sexual violence against women and girls.

12
00:00:38,920 --> 00:00:41,760
Targeted attacks on civilian buildings such as hospitals and churches.

13
00:00:42,260 --> 00:00:44,460
Many businesses have been subject to extensive eating.

14
00:00:44,660 --> 00:00:48,380
In the space of six months, more than 3.3 million people have been displaced.

15
00:00:48,760 --> 00:00:52,000
This includes 2.6 million people being displaced inside Sudan

16
00:00:52,000 --> 00:00:56,700
and more than 738,000 people having to flee to neighbouring countries.

17
00:00:56,700 --> 00:01:01,040
Saving this post makes the algorithm see it as valuable and in turn shown to more people.

18
00:01:01,380 --> 00:01:03,240
The more people that sees it, the better.

